Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.87,0:00:19.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.99,0:00:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.33,0:00:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.49,0:00:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.31,0:00:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.87,0:00:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.73,0:00:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.09,0:00:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.65,0:00:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide,\Nraise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.57,0:01:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place that\Nthe end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.01,0:01:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary till\Nsomeone proves it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.21,0:01:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all, through\Nall the trouble and times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.57,0:01:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache\Nand through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.91,0:01:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there to stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.17,0:01:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.27,0:01:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.31,0:01:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.43,0:01:33.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.97,0:01:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.19,0:01:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.79,0:01:42.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wanna be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.13,0:01:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on a cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.41,0:01:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.17,0:01:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to be king\Nof the pirates right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.87,0:01:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you must be completely\Nout of your rubbery mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.29,0:01:59.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea what that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.29,0:02:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah when he first told me it was shocking
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.23,0:02:03.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he's Completely\Nserious that's how he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.59,0:02:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i suppose.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.59,0:02:13.30,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(726,0)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(684,726,\1a&H00&)}The First
Dialogue: 2,0:02:07.59,0:02:13.30,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(726,0)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}The First
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.99,0:02:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's what i promised you there's three i
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.85,0:02:12.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,couldn't tell which was\Nyours so i just took
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.63,0:02:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all Of them all of them belong to me i use
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.73,0:02:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sentoryu the three swords\Nstyle just know that if
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.05,0:02:20.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you Fight with me now\Nyou'll be a government
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.67,0:02:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,defying villain so it's\Neither that or you're
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.21,0:02:24.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,left out here And killed by the Marines
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.97,0:02:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,execution style what are\Nyou the son of the devil?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.39,0:02:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it doesn't matter Because\Nif I don't choose your side
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.11,0:02:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just end up dead on\Nthese sticks. So let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.81,0:02:40.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're finally gonna join my\Ncrew! This is the best thing ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.35,0:02:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You quit celebrating already\Nand get these ropes off me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.83,0:02:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what the what is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.71,0:02:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bullets just bounced right off him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.19,0:02:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat's no ordinary\Nhuman like the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.93,0:02:52.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have eaten one\Nof those devil fruits
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.77,0:02:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that we've heard all those rumors about.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.73,0:02:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Devil Fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.64,0:02:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hidden treasure of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.47,0:02:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.63,0:03:01.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They got these things on here tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.53,0:03:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, quit screwing around!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.11,0:03:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what abilities they\Nhave, all who oppose me are executed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.39,0:03:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the guns won't work, we chop! Up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.83,0:03:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's funny, the nuts got\Ntighter instead of looser.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.85,0:03:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me one of my damn swords now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.41,0:03:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.41,0:03:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roronoa Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.01,0:03:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh wow, that's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.03,0:03:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make one move and you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.81,0:03:41.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.49,0:03:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today I officially become a\Ncriminal, having fought the Marines.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.15,0:03:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'll become a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.81,0:03:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I can promise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.23,0:03:54.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I want you to know one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.11,0:03:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While I'm with you, the only thing I\Ndedicate myself to is fulfilling my ambition.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.77,0:03:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which is?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.68,0:04:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be nothing less than the\Nworld's greatest swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.07,0:04:05.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If somewhere along the way\NI have to give that up,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.59,0:04:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I want you to accept responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.85,0:04:10.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After which, you get to apologize to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.57,0:04:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world's greatest swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.83,0:04:13.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.21,0:04:18.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The King of the Pirates wouldn't have\Nany less than the best on his crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.53,0:04:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big talker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.69,0:04:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From this point on, no matter\Nif I'm a criminal or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.77,0:04:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will spread the name\NZoro throughout the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.87,0:04:27.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you standing there frozen for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.93,0:04:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to kill all\Nthree of them right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.31,0:04:33.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might want to duck!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.73,0:04:35.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.49,0:04:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.40,0:04:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You knocked them all down!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.23,0:04:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wanna tell me what you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.25,0:04:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just a guy who ate the Gum-Gum fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.13,0:04:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the Gum-Gum fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.81,0:04:50.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A rubber person?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.03,0:04:53.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like he does have\Nthe Devil Fruit powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.01,0:04:56.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, we don't stand\Na chance against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.11,0:04:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, just look at them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.21,0:04:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.13,0:05:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We couldn't even take on Zoro by himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.41,0:05:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a direct order.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.15,0:05:08.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every marine that just spouted weakness,\Npull your gun out and shoot yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.15,0:05:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do anything with\Nweak soldiers but babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.01,0:05:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.69,0:05:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rankless, lowlife bums!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.75,0:05:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no right to defy my superiority!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.77,0:05:38.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Marine Captain X-Hand Morgan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.31,0:05:41.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.13,0:05:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.73,0:05:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look! He's been hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.81,0:05:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.99,0:06:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now die!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.91,0:06:04.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.75,0:06:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The captain's getting bubbled out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.37,0:06:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.43,0:06:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call yourself a marine, but you\Ndestroyed my friend Kobe's dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.91,0:06:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.11,0:06:22.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.19,0:06:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at what I got!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.49,0:06:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.47,0:06:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.38,0:06:31.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you would pay attention to me, I have\Na hostage here you might want to look at!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.31,0:06:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Helmepo's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.79,0:06:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.70,0:06:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.01,0:06:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you value your Squad little\Nfriend's life, you won't move a muscle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.73,0:06:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.64,0:06:41.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why move and I'll shoot him, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.87,0:06:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wolf, listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.97,0:06:50.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let anything that happens\Nto me stop you no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.11,0:06:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I die!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.23,0:06:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, you got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.25,0:06:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hear that, you big idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.83,0:06:57.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koby is ready to die by your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.59,0:06:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you move!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.87,0:07:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said don't move or I'll shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.65,0:07:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.65,0:07:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.73,0:07:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.25,0:07:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time's up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.45,0:07:10.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For I am Fearless Marine\NCaptain Axe and Morgan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.15,0:07:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy, hurry up and kill him already!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.49,0:07:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.89,0:07:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice one!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.47,0:07:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.73,0:07:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just doing my job, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.79,0:07:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Morgan has been beaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.77,0:07:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.81,0:07:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those guys are unreal!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.23,0:07:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there's anyone else who wants to step\Nforward to fight us, then do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.53,0:07:56.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're free!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.33,0:07:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.24,0:07:59.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The train is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.49,0:08:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a glorious day!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.69,0:08:03.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.81,0:08:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like they're all happy\Nthat their captain was beaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.67,0:08:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must have been afraid of him\Nfor a long time before we showed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.43,0:08:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro! Are you okay? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.71,0:08:19.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just... hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.83,0:08:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am stuffed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.31,0:08:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having not eaten for three weeks, I was\Nready to gnaw up through my bootstraps!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.89,0:08:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you're\Nfinished, Lightweight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.87,0:08:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the hell can you have a bigger appetite\Nthan a guy who hasn't eaten in weeks?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.47,0:08:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just tastes too good, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.25,0:08:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Colby?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.16,0:08:46.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.25,0:08:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for fixing it for us. My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.21,0:08:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, you guys did save the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.39,0:08:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the most amazing man I've ever met!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.91,0:08:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I am, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.57,0:08:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be more amazing when I'm king of\Nthe pirates and I have the One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.07,0:09:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and the best crew on the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.65,0:09:06.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, where are you and your crew\Nplanning on traveling when you leave here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.65,0:09:07.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean it's not obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.99,0:09:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're headed straight for the Grand Line!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.43,0:09:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.34,0:09:13.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you completely lost your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.53,0:09:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have two crew members!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.61,0:09:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way you're equipped\Nfor the Grand Line, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.91,0:09:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard about it, but I never\Nknew it was such an awful place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.03,0:09:21.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's worse than you think!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.13,0:09:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know that this world\Nhas two oceans, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.91,0:09:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is an enormous land mass\Nthat cuts across both of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.37,0:09:30.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is called the Red Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.91,0:09:34.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Legend tells of a town that sits\Ndead center on the Red Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.51,0:09:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Grand Line is set to cut\Nthrough this town at a right
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.69,0:09:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,angle and stretch all the way\Naround the rest of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.01,0:09:44.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The story goes on to say that Gold Roger,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.15,0:09:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the King of the Pirates, had once obtained\Neverything this world had to offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.09,0:09:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before he died, he said that he left the\Ngreat One Piece treasure at this location.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.19,0:09:58.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since, pirates have\Nset sail for the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.51,0:10:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.42,0:10:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the place is nothing but a battlefield,\Nand some even call it the Pirate Graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.47,0:10:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard stories about it\Nfrom people passing through.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.59,0:10:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The customers say that no\None who has ever entered
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.65,0:10:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Grand Line comes\Nout of that place alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.77,0:10:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which is really too bad, because that's\Nwhere the One Piece is said to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.19,0:10:21.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that's exactly where we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.43,0:10:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we have to live with it. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.99,0:10:24.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't agree!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.19,0:10:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.10,0:10:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not going with us, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.03,0:10:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, but I still worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.75,0:10:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it so wrong to care\Nabout the two of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.73,0:10:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy and I haven't known each\Nother for years or anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.61,0:10:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'd still consider him a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.45,0:10:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you say? Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.65,0:10:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We may have to part ways,\Nbut we'll always be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.29,0:10:48.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I was just a little\Nkid, I never had any friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.25,0:10:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much less anyone who would\Nbother fighting on my behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.99,0:10:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I always tried my hardest\Nnever to fight for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.61,0:11:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the two of you have taught me a\Nlesson I could never learn on my own,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.77,0:11:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how to live for what I believe in!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.73,0:11:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I've decided to make my\None childhood dream a reality,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.15,0:11:08.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm going to join the Marines!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.85,0:11:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then don't you think you should be a\Nlittle more concerned with your situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.23,0:11:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you did spend two\Nyears in Alvita's pirate ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.31,0:11:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if you were nothing\Nbut her cabin boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.55,0:11:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Marines' information\Ngathering is top-notch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.41,0:11:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll find out about your time\Nwith Alvida, and you'll never join.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.79,0:11:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.81,0:11:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.07,0:11:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We heard that you fellas\Nare actually pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.31,0:11:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this rumor true?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.53,0:11:41.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, and I just added the\Nfirst member to my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.83,0:11:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So pretty much the whole\Nthing just became official.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.59,0:11:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We appreciate everything you\Ndid to save our town from
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.15,0:11:50.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that horrible tyrant who\Nterrorized us all for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.39,0:11:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.30,0:11:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now that we know that you're pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.43,0:11:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we cannot sit idly by and watch\Nyou go about your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.19,0:11:59.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Therefore, you and your crew will\Nneed to leave this town immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.33,0:12:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But out of respect for what you've done,\Nwe will not report you to headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.47,0:12:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.83,0:12:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you find the\Nnerve to talk like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.71,0:12:10.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before these pirates came along, you\Nguys were as scared of Arlong as we were.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.51,0:12:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without them, we'd still\Nbe under his reign.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.79,0:12:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We owe them our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.81,0:12:19.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.57,0:12:22.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for all of the food, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.45,0:12:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.61,0:12:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're leaving already?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.27,0:12:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.19,0:12:35.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you part of the crew, as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.71,0:12:37.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.11,0:12:43.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.27,0:12:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he with you or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.71,0:12:50.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I can tell you is what he's\Nbeen busy doing up to this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.07,0:12:52.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mulfi, you wouldn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.33,0:12:56.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there was this\Nfantastically fat pirate lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.49,0:12:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think her name was Alvida.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.37,0:12:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mofi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.77,0:13:04.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they find out I ran with the pirate\Ncrew, I'll never join the marine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.09,0:13:08.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She carried around this\Nhuge iron club, and boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.17,0:13:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she was the nastiest looking\Nwoman I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.77,0:13:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For two years, this wimpy kid was her\Nown private cabin boy. Please stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.85,0:13:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.63,0:13:18.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mofi, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.65,0:13:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.01,0:13:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that was a dumb move!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.61,0:13:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.21,0:13:36.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.77,0:13:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't have you pirates ripping up\Nthis town any more than you already have,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.13,0:13:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.39,0:13:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.30,0:13:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You made your point.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.22,0:13:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let him fall to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.75,0:13:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's obvious you're not Gourmet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.39,0:13:52.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So stop badgering the poor kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.77,0:13:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and take your leave of\Nour town this instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.53,0:14:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.71,0:14:06.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy did that just to help me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.79,0:14:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He worked me up and got me so mad that I'd
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.55,0:14:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hit him and look like\NI wasn't on his side.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.43,0:14:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even at the very end of our journey together,\NI wound up continuing to rely on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.57,0:14:24.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't do anything for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.31,0:14:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing's changed for me at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.85,0:14:32.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am such an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.99,0:14:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.91,0:14:37.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, sir! Please,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.23,0:14:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you have to let me join\Nthe Marines I'll clean
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.31,0:14:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and scrub and do any chores\Nthat you'd like me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.13,0:14:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything to become a Marine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.71,0:14:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant, I can't say\NI fully trust this kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.21,0:14:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be against the\Nidea if there weren't clear
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.43,0:14:56.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cases of certain Marines\Nactually being pirate spies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.33,0:15:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say we should conduct\Na background check first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.43,0:15:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what you say, I am a\Nman who will become a Marine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.13,0:15:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.29,0:15:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't tell you how many of our comrades
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.59,0:15:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have been killed by\Npirates over the years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.05,0:15:17.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a big step you're taking. So?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.13,0:15:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Permission to join granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.17,0:15:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.63,0:15:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a thin act you put on back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.77,0:15:29.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be surprised if\Nthey see right through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.17,0:15:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kobe should be able to\Nhandle the rest on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.33,0:15:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have faith in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.37,0:15:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is a fitting way to leave this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.29,0:15:36.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unable to turn back because\Neveryone here hates us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.05,0:15:38.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very pirate-like.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.53,0:15:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it sure is. Buffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.37,0:15:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can never thank you enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.41,0:15:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've done more for me\Nthan anyone ever has!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.71,0:15:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of a marine\Nthanking a pirate before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.11,0:15:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one for the history books.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.49,0:15:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll meet again, Koby!\NSomeday! Bye, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.03,0:16:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope to see you again someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.37,0:16:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All hands salute!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.91,0:16:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.57,0:16:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good friend you have there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.83,0:16:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Men,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.81,0:16:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seeing as our current salute\Nis in violation of marine law,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.43,0:16:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we will all go without\Nfood for three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.33,0:16:29.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do we all understand this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.65,0:16:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.81,0:16:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.99,0:16:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for us to set our\Nheading for the Grand Line!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.31,0:16:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a kid, I never stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.87,0:16:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Searching for a great treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.45,0:17:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a map in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.23,0:17:05.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I knew would lead me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.85,0:17:09.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to find my way to that place!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.05,0:17:12.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before someone could beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.41,0:17:17.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The promised land was in my grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.13,0:17:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I wouldn't let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.85,0:17:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La la la la?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.59,0:17:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.03,0:17:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La la la la la!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.63,0:17:32.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stop chasing\Nit until it comes true!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.81,0:17:38.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if the world ever changes,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.35,0:17:41.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I call out your name!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.83,0:17:48.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We return to the time when\Neverything's the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.43,0:17:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm with you,\Nmy memories won't fade!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.35,0:18:00.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waiting for that one true dream?

